# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SN-Launcher — ignore rules
#
# The important part of this file is the **Secrets** block. SN-Launcher is a
# launcher app with no server and no API keys of its own, but it sits in the
# same working directory as whatever else you build, and people habitually drop
# a `.env` next to a project. Committing one leaks whatever is in it — and a
# leaked key is leaked forever, because it stays in the git history even after
# you delete the file in a later commit.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never commit real credentials.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
secrets.json
secrets.yaml
credentials.json
service-account*.json
gha-creds-*.json
.npmrc
.pypirc
.netrc

# ── Flutter / Dart ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.dart_tool/
.packages
.pub-cache/
.pub/
build/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pubspec.lock          # apps: commit this deliberately; libraries: ignore it

# ── Android ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
android/.gradle/
android/captures/
android/gradle.properties.bak
android/local.properties      # contains your SDK path — machine-specific
android/app/debug/
android/app/profile/
android/app/release/
*.apk
*.aab
*.jks
android/key.properties

# ── Desktop / native ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
macos/Pods/
macos/Flutter/ephemeral/
linux/flutter/ephemeral/
*.dylib
*.so

# ── Editors / OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# ── Logs, coverage, captures from the device test rig ────────────────────────
*.log
coverage/
build/device/*.png
build/shots/*.png
!build/device/.gitkeep

# ── Scratch ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
scratch/
tmp/
*.bak.msym-cache/
.photo-cache.jpg

# Release artefacts. Built by tool/build_variants.sh and attached to the
# GitHub release rather than committed - they are large and reproducible.
dist/

# Rust build output. The compiled .so files ARE committed, under
# android/app/src/main/jniLibs, so the APK can be built without a Rust
# toolchain — but the intermediate cargo target directory is not.
native/licence_filter/target/
